  (text "A passive adaptor: the badge's 3.3 V, ground and I2C lines go straight to a Nunchuck plug. No chip, no LED, no resistor." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c4fd2214-83c2-593d-9ba6-03ebc0c7954b"))
  (text "BADGE POWER ONLY. No coin cell and no SAO / OFF / BAT switch (a recorded exception to docs/standard.md section 3): there is nothing" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a580cb06-2dd3-5582-a49f-1674d72e6ffe"))
  (text "to light, and a Nunchuck is only useful while the badge is talking to it. With no cell on the board nothing can back-feed one." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dfb9be19-b902-5dc1-adb6-d1768b6c44f2"))
  (text "No I2C pull-ups on the board (docs/standard.md section 1; the maker fitted none either). A Nunchuck answers at I2C address 0x52." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bf443f56-3b81-581d-831a-109af2b679eb"))
  (text "J1 is the only part that is bought and placed." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 92.71 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "25fdb0f5-58e5-5d73-acec-a7ecc3d552a5"))
  (text "X2 is board copper: five gold fingers on the board edge (three on the back, two on the front) that the Nunchuck plug grips." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "93d1b885-2641-5a10-9ec2-45f49559c6a0"))
  (text "X3 and X4 are the maker's two Qwiic sockets (JST SH 4-pin, SM04B-SRSS-TB): pads only, NOT FITTED, not in the BOM." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b36b47af-8747-513e-ac0a-850edbbc8918"))
  (text "Solder one on by hand to chain other 3.3 V I2C boards. SAO GPIO1 and GPIO2 are not used." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 135.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bf0c0b2c-9c7e-571e-b95b-1cf2a14cf2d2"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
